            <ArticleTitle>Muscle pain, fatigue, and fasiculations.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>697-709</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>This article discusses muscle pain, fatigue, and fasiculations. Muscle pain and fatigue are common problems in general medicine and in neurology, while fasiculations raise concern about a potentially ominous disease. The author reviews the conditions that cause pain and similar conditions arising from nonmuscular soft tissues. The article includes a general evaluation to be used for each of these clinical problems.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
